                    Secret; Rybat; [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >cryptonym not declassified</hi>]; Operational Immediate. Received at
                    2329Z.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d102-f2" n="2" xml:id="d102-f2-content">
                <p>CIA telegram 27099 to Leopoldville, November 30,
                    authorized the requested expenditure. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
